  (text "Key scanner: two MCP23017 (0x22, 0x23) scan the 8 x 10 key matrix of sheet 8" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "204f9dfe-588b-5354-8edb-5e78b1c97551"))
  (text "Chosen instead of the design's TCA8418 for latency: the TCA8418 scans its keypad every 25 ms and reports" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "37631e8f-5e54-50a1-92d8-52209b06b842"))
  (text "a press after 25-40 ms (TI SCPS215G, 8.6.2.15); the design asks for <= 15 ms. This is the design's own" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a549ca90-17c3-5b99-90ff-1081a43c9f8d"))
  (text "fallback scanner. Core 0 scans: a full 10-column scan takes about 2-3 ms of I2C time at 400 kHz." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1380cc4f-d88a-586e-a79d-69484631908c"))
  (text "Columns are outputs, one driven low at a time, the others high; rows are inputs with the internal pull-ups." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0fcaa11d-54db-51d3-b0d5-1f17064ee7b2"))
  (text "U801 GPA0-6 = ROW0-6, GPB0 = ROW7 (all rows in one 2-byte read of U801); U801 GPB1-7 = COL0-6," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 154.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "739f1a14-8afe-5b6f-bfcd-c73dcdcd1926"))
  (text "GPA7 = COL7; U802 GPA0/GPA1 = COL8/COL9. The output-only GPA7/GPB7 only ever drive columns." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "12faa3b2-8b98-55df-802f-3088191641d0"))
  (text "A pressed key pulls its row to ~0.25 V through its BAT54J, below VIL = 0.2 VDD = 0.66 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "53ee7ce7-11e8-5ffa-b7f5-eeacc10277e5"))
  (text "Unused U802 pins and all INTA/INTB are left open (configure them as outputs). No interrupt line: polled." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e03bc956-b7fa-57bc-bcda-6fe290a1d305"))
